  "content": "<p><span>最好搭配 JEI 遊玩</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>生物：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\"><span>有兩種非極限模式的實體，包括：</span>\n<p><span>冰元素：生成於雪地生態域（不含積雪沙灘）與冰凍生態域<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_8a9d0546-0a88-49c1-8ac4-e3556c22aae7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"251\" height=\"251\"><br></span><span>岩漿元素：生成於地獄與沙漠<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_82f20193-6098-4faa-8584-be00bff5ca88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"253\" height=\"253\"><br></span></p>\n<span>有三種極限模式專屬生物：</span>\n<p><span>先驅者：擊殺生物（包含其他先驅者）後有 25% 機率生成<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_658afbb5-b00d-4eaf-99b8-9386baf8c5cb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>冰霜毀滅者：替代冰元素生成<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_1ae6bba7-3767-4f53-8920-3a4e2a4914b6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"258\" height=\"258\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>岩漿毀滅者：替代岩漿元素生成<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_f639f391-202c-4c3a-8e05-8e1fa87cc764.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"262\" height=\"262\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>有三種 Boss 生物：</span></p>\n<p><span>至尊仲裁者：一階段<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_5e4457a3-cf57-474a-8579-09ab3e4ff0d7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"272\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>破壞者札諾克：二階段<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_c82279fe-6ec5-4572-a55b-6dd67b17f7b5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\"><br></span><span><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_714f30ad-294d-4b8b-a4df-aa17cc167ad9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"275\"></span></p>\n<p><span>無盡者·破滅之伊芬尼魯斯：三階段<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_c92983df-e160-4840-aa76-7f62b5c5abc5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_902d83b2-e75c-40b0-a655-dd56c43ab4bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/948751/description_830f693d-8b3d-4d98-b46e-44b10578b68a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><br></span></p>\n</div><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>極限模式會阻擋什麼：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h6><span>它移除了分裂護甲。</span></h6>\n</div><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>新增內容：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>暗黑劍、暗黑長矛、暗黑護甲、自訂生物模型護甲、一系列成就（與多數模組相同），以及六種附魔。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
